 ## 5. Using `benchmarks.utils`
 
+For absolute-pose checkpoints, the exported `eef10_to_robocasa12d` and
+`eef20d_to_robocasa12d` helpers convert the target orientation relative to the
+current orientation into a shortest-path axis-angle command, including exact
+180° rotations. Controller scaling and optional clipping apply afterward.
+These helpers require an absolute-pose action contract; the current RoboCasa365
+adapter uses its native delta-action contract.
+
 Client helpers live under `benchmarks/utils/client.py` and can be imported directly:
 
 ```python
